<section class="cc-about" id="about">
  <div class="cc-about-inner">
    <div class="cc-eyebrow cc-eyebrow--center">About Jacob</div>
    <h2 class="cc-h2" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4); max-width: 22ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      The teacher <em>and the path.</em>
    </h2>

    <p>
      Jacob Vermeulen is the founder of Somatic Vocal Healing and the
      Klankopstellingen (Sound Constellation) method. Over the past years
      he has guided thousands of students worldwide through this work —
      through workshops, the 12-week foundational course, certification
      training, the CEEE program, and retreats in Europe and South Africa.
    </p>
    <p>
      His teaching is direct, embodied, and rooted in his own life. He
      doesn't claim to have learned this from books. He learned it the way
      most real things are learned — by going through it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
